# Independent escape/unescape cases for PolskiTextCodec.
# Format: description | input | expected output
# These run via biome verify against a JS subjects file (P15: independent of codec output).
# NOT RUN on Kotlin until a subjects file for Kotlin is wired.

SOURCES 1
SUBJECTS ./escape-subjects.mjs
SUBJECT escapeText
plain text unchanged | hello | hello
tab escaped | a	b | a\tb
newline escaped | a
b | a\nb
backslash doubled | a\b | a\\b
dollar escaped | a$b | a\$b
control char escaped | a b | a\u0001b
SUBJECT unescapeText
plain unchanged | hello | hello
tab unescaped | a\tb | a	b
newline unescaped | a\nb | a
b
backslash unescaped | a\\b | a\b
control unescaped | a\u0001b | a b
